# Web server
PORT=3000
NODE_ENV=development

# MySQL connection used by backend/db.js
DB_HOST=127.0.0.1
DB_PORT=3306
DB_USER=root
DB_PASSWORD=change-me
DB_NAME=railway_demo

# Session cookie lifetime: 7 days
SESSION_TTL_HOURS=168

项目默认 MySQL 配置在 `app/db.py`：
- host: `localhost`
- port: `3306`
- user: `root`
- password: `123456`
- database: `doc_code`
